{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026cH88fDSPY61795131057.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>AMD被沽空機構Hunterbrook指控，涉嫌違反對華出口限制，拖累公司股價一度跌一成一。</p><p></p><p>人工智能晶片商輝達的競爭對手AMD，被Hunterbrook Capital建立空倉。Hunterbrook相關機構發表報告，指AMD依賴中國市場發展，存在潛在風險，報告還提到公司在中國，有龐大的供應鏈。</p><p></p><p>AMD發表聲明回應，指Hunterbrook的說法，歪曲了公司的商業行為及業務關係，公司遵守美國出口管制法律法規，並建立了嚴格的流程，以確保全球業務符合相關規定。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T00:43:53.482481+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":231,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T23:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T02:37:14.079177+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T00:37:17.159257+00:00","content_hash":"900f38ab9d0a7e180ea089a6c3cc79921eb82d626c393d6841accb3dd9373679","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T00:43:53.482481+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}